    "how.title": "Every engagement goes through the same six phases.", "how.1.title": "Observe",
    "how.1.desc": "We physically visit your organization. We shadow a full process from start to finish on the work floor, run on-site interviews and working sessions with the people doing the work, and combine that with focused remote follow-up. Online surveys alone are deliberately not enough here.", "how.2.title": "Model",
    "how.2.desc": "From what we saw, we simplify the process before any technology comes in: which steps disappear, which get automated, and where a person keeps deciding. This is also where we fix the architecture and the KPIs.", "how.3.title": "Engineer",
    "how.3.desc": "Our team builds the working solution: AI agents, workflows and API integrations, document processing, knowledge bases and dashboards, with monitoring and logging in a controlled cloud environment from day one.", "how.4.title": "Integrate",
    "how.4.desc": "All components are integrated with CRM, ERP, HR and financial systems into one infrastructure, with secure data exchange, authentication, authorization, error handling and attention to scalability and continuity.", "how.5.title": "Validate",
    "how.5.desc": "Before the solution goes live, we test whether it meets the goals set in phase 2: functional, integration and performance testing, security, plus acceptance testing with your team. No measurable result means going back to the drawing board.", "how.6.title": "Optimize",
