    "legal.backHome": "Back to home", "legal.privacy.title": "Privacy Policy",
    "legal.privacy.updated": "Last updated: June 2026", "legal.privacy.intro": "FR Operations (\"we\", \"us\") respects your privacy. This page explains what personal data we collect, why, and what rights you have under the GDPR.",
    "legal.privacy.s1.title": "Who we are", "legal.privacy.s1.body": "FR Operations is a Rotterdam-based automation studio (KVK: 00000000). Our data contact is info@frops.nl.",
    "legal.privacy.s2.title": "What we collect", "legal.privacy.s2.body": "Through our contact form we collect the name, company, email address and message you provide. We don't collect payment details on this site, and you don't need an account.",
    "legal.privacy.s3.title": "Why we process it", "legal.privacy.s3.body": "We use this data only to respond to your enquiry, schedule a consultation, and deliver agreed services. We never sell or rent your data.",
    "legal.privacy.s4.title": "Legal basis", "legal.privacy.s4.body": "We rely on your consent when you submit the form, and on contract performance once a client relationship begins.",
    "legal.privacy.s5.title": "How long we keep it", "legal.privacy.s5.body": "Enquiry data is kept up to 24 months. Client data is kept for the duration of the engagement plus the retention period required by Dutch tax law (currently 7 years for financial records).",
    "legal.privacy.s6.title": "Cookies & analytics", "legal.privacy.s6.body": "This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics: a cookieless, privacy-first tool that counts visits without tracking you individually or sharing data with advertisers. It only runs if you accept it in the cookie banner; you can change your choice anytime via 'Cookie settings' in the footer. We separately store your chosen display language in your browser's local storage, purely for convenience, which you can clear via your browser settings.", "legal.privacy.s6.cta": "Manage cookie settings",
    "legal.privacy.s7.title": "Sharing your data", "legal.privacy.s7.body": "We only share data with processors strictly necessary to run our business (e.g. email or CRM tools), under GDPR-compliant agreements, and never transfer it outside the EU/EEA without proper safeguards.",
    "legal.privacy.s8.title": "Security", "legal.privacy.s8.body": "We apply appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, loss or misuse.",
    "legal.privacy.s9.title": "Your rights", "legal.privacy.s9.body": "Under the GDPR you can access, correct, or erase your data, restrict or object to its processing, and request portability. You can also lodge a complaint with the Dutch Data Protection Authority (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens). To exercise any right, email info@frops.nl.",
    "legal.privacy.s10.title": "Changes to this policy", "legal.privacy.s10.body": "We may update this policy occasionally. The version published here is always the current one.",
    "legal.privacy.s11.title": "Contact", "legal.privacy.s11.body": "Questions about this policy? Email info@frops.nl or write to Wilhelminakade 12, 3072 AP Rotterdam, NL.",
    "legal.terms.title": "Terms of Service", "legal.terms.updated": "Last updated: June 2026",
    "legal.terms.intro": "These General Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\") apply to every consultation, proposal and service agreement between FR Operations (\"we\") and the client (\"you\"). By engaging our services, you accept these Terms.", "legal.terms.s1.title": "Our services",
    "legal.terms.s1.body": "FR Operations provides AI automation consulting, workflow automation, AI agents/chatbots, system integrations and related custom software, as described on this website or in a written proposal.", "legal.terms.s2.title": "Quotes & agreements",
